From 77e6c114a673571746045e0ece5d15595321268b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yuuzulight <yuuzulight@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 05:34:45 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] Forms: enctype=multipart/form-data sends the chosen files

A form submit always urlencoded its fields and skipped every file input, so a
file picked through DOM.setFileInputFiles never reached the server. The submit
now builds a multipart body (file bytes included) and hands the network layer a
marker line naming the content type; the network layer sends the rest as bytes.
---
 crates/obscura-js/js/bootstrap.js   | 38 +++++++++++++++++++-
 crates/obscura-net/src/client.rs    | 13 ++++---
 crates/obscura-net/src/form_body.rs | 55 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 crates/obscura-net/src/lib.rs       |  1 +
 4 files changed, 99 insertions(+), 8 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 crates/obscura-net/src/form_body.rs

